            "title": "Supplement Needs Heart Stack - 180 Capsules",
            "handle": "supplement-needs-heart-stack-180-capsules",
            "body_html": "<h2>Supplement Needs Heart Stack — 15-Ingredient Cardiovascular Support Formula | 180 Capsules / 30 Servings</h2>\n\n<p><strong>Supplement Needs Heart Stack</strong> (formerly C-V Stack) is a fully transparent, non-proprietary cardiovascular health formula containing <strong>15 active ingredients at efficacious doses</strong>, formulated by Dr Dean St Mart PhD. Built around a comprehensive combination of polyphenols, antioxidants, plant extracts, CoQ10 and essential vitamins, it provides structured, multi-pathway cardiovascular support that a single-ingredient product simply cannot match.</p>\n\n<p>Rather than relying on one compound, Heart Stack combines 10 polyphenol and antioxidant ingredients — including the premium EvNolMax full-spectrum Vitamin E complex, Citrus Bergamot, Green Tea Extract, Pomegranate, Olive Leaf, Garlic (Allicin), Grape Seed, Black Seed and Pycrinil Artichoke Extract — alongside Co-Enzyme Q10, Astaxanthin, Vitamin D3 (5000IU), Vitamin K2 MK-7 and Thiamine HCl. This is cardiovascular health supplementation done comprehensively, not as an afterthought.</p>\n\n<p>Designed for those who want more structured cardiovascular support than a single-nutrient approach can offer, Heart Stack is built to reduce oxidative stress across multiple biological pathways simultaneously. It works equally well as a standalone daily foundation or as a core component of a wider health stack.</p>\n\n<p>Heart Stack is a core member of the Supplement Needs <strong>Advanced Health Stack</strong>, sitting alongside Liver Stack and Kidney &amp; Blood Pressure Stack for those building a complete organ health protocol. It can also be complemented further with SerraNatto+, Lipid Pro+, Lysine Powder and Vitamin C Powder for fully comprehensive cardiovascular coverage.</p>\n\n<p><em>Suitable for Vegetarians. Halal Certified. ISO/GMP Manufacturing Standard. Manufactured in a facility that processes egg, nuts, milk, soy, fish and shellfish. Do not exceed the recommended daily dose. Consult a healthcare professional before use if you are taking medication or managing a cardiovascular condition. Not suitable for those under 18, pregnant or breastfeeding.</em></p>",
